WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:37.680 --> 01:39.520
-Catch her!
-Go!

01:39.600 --> 01:41.080
Kill!

01:48.280 --> 01:50.360
-Don't let her go.
-Attack!

01:52.480 --> 01:54.120
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

02:00.000 --> 02:01.240
See it now?

02:02.400 --> 02:04.000
This is human nature.

02:16.920 --> 02:18.320
Can you calm this rebellion?

02:18.400 --> 02:21.120
Divine artifacts cannot interfere
with human affairs.

02:23.320 --> 02:24.400
Then just watch here.

02:26.640 --> 02:27.960
You lost the bet.

02:29.840 --> 02:30.960
The third bet.

02:31.880 --> 02:33.560
Human nature is selfish.

02:33.640 --> 02:34.640
They repay kindness with hatred.

02:35.800 --> 02:36.960
According to the bet,

02:37.480 --> 02:38.800
you should return with me.

02:44.560 --> 02:47.040
Qingyang, spare their lives,

02:47.120 --> 02:48.360
and take care of yourself.

02:48.880 --> 02:49.720
No,

02:50.480 --> 02:51.640
I've won.

03:24.480 --> 03:25.760
It's time for you to tell me

03:26.640 --> 03:29.280
how to use the Qiankun Pearl
to break Zhao Ming's death fate.

03:30.440 --> 03:32.320
Fate cannot be altered.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.720
The life-and-death fate is inevitable.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.600
The Qiankun Pearl can only transfer harm.

03:36.680 --> 03:39.160
One of you and Zhao Ming must die.

03:40.440 --> 03:41.320
How do we transfer it?

03:57.760 --> 03:59.240
"If disaster strikes,

03:59.800 --> 04:01.080
bear it yourself."

04:02.240 --> 04:04.200
Just sign your names here.

04:12.480 --> 04:14.960
Now, can you let me go?

04:22.800 --> 04:24.040
Seeing you return,

04:24.600 --> 04:25.680
I feel much more at ease.

04:25.760 --> 04:26.840
It's been days.

04:26.920 --> 04:28.960
Your swordsmanship
is still terrible. Move!

04:33.040 --> 04:34.200
Hurry, go!

04:34.280 --> 04:35.200
Qingyang!

04:39.240 --> 04:40.120
Qingyang!

04:41.480 --> 04:42.320
-Are you okay?
-I'm fine.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.880
Qingyang!

05:00.480 --> 05:02.600
Qingyang! Qingyang!

05:03.760 --> 05:04.720
Qingyang!

05:05.240 --> 05:06.720
Qingyang!

05:06.800 --> 05:07.720
Qingyang!

05:07.800 --> 05:08.840
Don't worry.

05:09.360 --> 05:11.960
You used your blood to cure my poison.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.120
I took this strike for you.

05:13.200 --> 05:14.360
Consider it my repayment to you.

05:14.440 --> 05:15.360
Don't be afraid.

05:15.440 --> 05:16.360
I'll find a way to save you.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.960
Alright, I'll wait for you.

05:18.840 --> 05:19.840
Wait for me!

05:24.040 --> 05:25.080
Qingyang!

05:27.480 --> 05:28.360
Che.

05:30.160 --> 05:31.440
Yan!

05:32.720 --> 05:34.520
Yan, these are the buns
you gave me yesterday.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.840
I'm returning them to you.

05:35.920 --> 05:37.480
Today, I'm going to the palace with them.

05:38.680 --> 05:40.680
Yan, why don't you come with us?

05:44.400 --> 05:45.280
Yan…

05:50.200 --> 05:51.200
Yan…

05:51.280 --> 05:52.400
Qingyang…

05:53.960 --> 05:55.120
Yan…

06:09.480 --> 06:10.720
Yan…

06:15.080 --> 06:16.480
In this lifetime…

06:20.440 --> 06:22.120
it seems like…

06:23.840 --> 06:25.440
we always fall just short…

06:28.080 --> 06:29.240
of happiness.

06:32.480 --> 06:34.040
Meeting you…

06:36.560 --> 06:38.440
has already made me very happy.

06:40.520 --> 06:41.520
Qingyang…

06:44.280 --> 06:45.760
if there is a next life…

06:49.720 --> 06:51.400
you must be free,

06:52.040 --> 06:53.040
joyful…

06:54.760 --> 06:57.040
and no need
to care about others' opinions.

07:00.240 --> 07:02.240
You should receive
all the love you deserve.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.160
Alright?

07:07.800 --> 07:09.080
Alright.

07:09.600 --> 07:10.760
I promise you.

07:12.680 --> 07:14.120
I also wish for you

07:14.880 --> 07:16.880
to be someone

07:17.400 --> 07:18.520
wealthy,

07:19.280 --> 07:20.520
safe,

07:22.720 --> 07:23.920
and happy in your next life.

07:25.080 --> 07:27.720
Never risking your life

07:28.720 --> 07:30.040
for gold or treasure again.

07:30.920 --> 07:33.200
If you fall for someone…

07:37.400 --> 07:38.920
you can just be with them.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.400
Wait for me.

08:58.560 --> 08:59.800
-His Majesty!
-His Majesty has returned!

08:59.880 --> 09:01.520
-His Majesty has returned!
-His Majesty has returned!

09:01.600 --> 09:03.480
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

09:03.560 --> 09:04.480
If you don't retreat,

09:04.560 --> 09:06.760
there will be no sacrifices tomorrow.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.680
Oh…

09:08.760 --> 09:09.880
-Hurry!
-Leave!

09:09.960 --> 09:11.520
-Hurry!
-Leave! Leave now!

09:11.600 --> 09:13.160
-Quickly!
-Move faster!

09:14.160 --> 09:15.200
Zhao Ming…

09:19.560 --> 09:20.600
Zhao Ming!

09:23.040 --> 09:24.040
Pearl.

09:24.120 --> 09:26.160
-Zhao Ming.
-I'm back.

09:28.280 --> 09:30.200
I failed to protect everyone.

09:41.640 --> 09:43.000
You've done enough.

09:49.800 --> 09:51.320
He Zhou has left the palace.

09:52.120 --> 09:52.960
He said

09:54.320 --> 09:56.240
he wants to bury Yan and Qingyang

09:56.760 --> 09:59.000
in the forest
far from the imperial palace,

10:00.360 --> 10:02.720
so that they won't be bound
in their next life.

10:07.920 --> 10:09.720
While you were gone,

10:10.720 --> 10:12.480
I often felt intense pain,

10:14.160 --> 10:17.000
as if your soul fragment was reminding me

10:17.080 --> 10:19.520
of the hardships you were enduring.

10:23.080 --> 10:26.480
I tried to find a way
to restore my Chaos Power,

10:27.560 --> 10:29.160
but nothing worked.

10:31.760 --> 10:33.440
Just thinking that I couldn't help you

10:34.000 --> 10:35.280
made me so sad.

10:37.600 --> 10:38.720
Zhao Ming,

10:40.800 --> 10:42.880
will the sacrifices truly happen tomorrow?

11:00.920 --> 11:02.400
I'm so tired, Pearl.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.200
But it's alright.

11:07.800 --> 11:09.120
Everything will soon be over.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.640
Zhao Ming,

11:16.200 --> 11:19.440
I will make sure your wishes come true.

11:20.880 --> 11:24.360
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

11:35.480 --> 11:38.280
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT

11:40.640 --> 11:41.680
MARRIAGE

11:52.640 --> 11:53.480
You're awake.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.000
What are you writing?

12:03.640 --> 12:04.600
A marriage agreement.

12:11.440 --> 12:13.720
PEARL

12:13.800 --> 12:15.000
Zhao Ming,

12:18.960 --> 12:20.160
I like you.

12:21.280 --> 12:22.840
I want to marry you.

12:24.880 --> 12:25.720
Will you marry me?

12:37.040 --> 12:38.240
You don't want to?

12:38.880 --> 12:40.240
Why tonight?

12:43.720 --> 12:44.800
Tomorrow,

12:46.200 --> 12:47.440
you'll ascend to challenge the deities.

12:50.560 --> 12:52.120
I want to marry you

12:52.920 --> 12:55.240
and face everything tomorrow together.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.880
Zhao Ming,

13:01.320 --> 13:02.400
promise me.

13:03.480 --> 13:04.440
Alright?

13:07.080 --> 13:08.200
Alright.

13:17.560 --> 13:19.120
PEARL

13:24.880 --> 13:26.240
Before signing the marriage agreement,

13:28.520 --> 13:29.840
I need to give you a betrothal gift first.

13:59.080 --> 13:59.920
Open it and see.

14:07.040 --> 14:08.640
This is the gift you gave me.

14:09.160 --> 14:10.760
And now it's my gift to you.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.360
Tonight is our engagement banquet.

14:17.760 --> 14:18.800
This is our ceremonial wine.

14:33.760 --> 14:35.600
Before drinking this wine,

14:36.720 --> 14:38.000
you must first sign
the marriage agreement.

14:41.440 --> 14:43.880
I can't just marry you without clarity.

14:48.720 --> 14:49.560
Alright.

14:51.560 --> 14:55.360
PEARL

14:59.480 --> 15:02.360
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT, ZHAO MING, PEARL

15:06.600 --> 15:07.600
Can we drink it now?

15:45.160 --> 15:46.080
Pearl,

15:47.440 --> 15:48.840
you've learned how to act human,

15:49.960 --> 15:51.600
but as for lying…

15:52.760 --> 15:54.280
you're not very good at it.

15:54.800 --> 15:56.680
IF DISASTER STRIKES, I WILL BEAR IT

16:21.600 --> 16:24.240
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT

16:35.400 --> 16:36.280
Pearl,

16:37.160 --> 16:38.600
you've been through so much these days.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.600
Get some good rest.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.920
When you wake up,

16:45.320 --> 16:46.960
everything will be over.

18:14.800 --> 18:16.320
Where are the divine servants?

18:16.400 --> 18:17.760
There won't be any divine servants.

18:18.280 --> 18:20.960
Zhao Ming,
are you defying the heavenly will?

18:21.040 --> 18:23.040
The deeds of the Divine Clan
are not righteous.

18:23.120 --> 18:24.160
Today,

18:24.920 --> 18:27.320
I vow that this world
will have only the sun and moon,

18:28.400 --> 18:29.920
no more deities.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.400
This is

18:32.040 --> 18:33.080
my lifelong wish.

19:06.720 --> 19:08.280
Without divine permission,

19:09.400 --> 19:12.160
you climbed the Celestial Ladder
and entered the heavenly realm!

19:12.240 --> 19:13.600
What is the heavenly realm?

19:13.680 --> 19:15.400
Heaven and earth reside
in the hearts of people.

19:15.480 --> 19:17.040
Fate is shaped by human actions.

19:17.120 --> 19:19.080
A deity is a deity,

19:20.000 --> 19:21.280
ruling over the three realms.

19:22.280 --> 19:23.560
This is the will of heaven.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.000
If deities are unjust,

19:25.520 --> 19:27.000
then I will overthrow them.

19:27.080 --> 19:28.840
If heaven is unrighteous,

19:28.920 --> 19:30.080
then I will defy it.

19:30.840 --> 19:32.480
I'll destroy evil deities

19:32.560 --> 19:34.360
and bring peace to the world.

19:34.960 --> 19:36.560
That is my path.

19:37.240 --> 19:39.320
The Saint Emperor disrespects the deities.

19:40.760 --> 19:41.600
Destroy him!

19:45.720 --> 19:46.880
Impossible!

19:46.960 --> 19:48.320
How do you have such power?

19:48.400 --> 19:49.440
The Divine Child…

19:49.520 --> 19:50.720
Zhao Ming is the Divine Child!

20:06.840 --> 20:08.560
To ask Fate for help…

20:16.400 --> 20:19.720
We, the deities,
humbly ask Your Grace for help!

20:20.680 --> 20:21.680
The Divine Clan faces crisis.

20:21.760 --> 20:23.920
We plead for Your Grace
to destroy the evil emperor!

20:24.760 --> 20:26.080
He's the Chosen of Heaven.

20:26.600 --> 20:27.840
He can be suppressed

20:28.760 --> 20:29.680
but not destroyed.

20:29.760 --> 20:32.400
We plead for Your Grace
to imprison the evil emperor,

20:32.480 --> 20:34.600
so he can never emerge again.

20:34.680 --> 20:37.040
Erase this figure from humanity!

20:37.720 --> 20:38.560
Approved.

21:08.520 --> 21:09.520
Sir…

21:10.040 --> 21:10.880
Perhaps

21:11.480 --> 21:13.560
you should address me as Fate.

21:18.320 --> 21:19.680
Evil Emperor Zhao Ming

21:20.640 --> 21:22.240
defied heaven to destroy deities,

21:22.760 --> 21:24.200
descended into a demon,

21:24.960 --> 21:26.280
and was imprisoned in the Lava.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.240
What Fate declares

21:29.320 --> 21:30.960
is the truth!

22:26.760 --> 22:28.080
Even now,

22:29.240 --> 22:30.840
do you still believe

22:30.920 --> 22:32.240
that humans can overcome heaven?

22:34.240 --> 22:35.600
Even now,

22:36.160 --> 22:37.640
I still firmly believe

22:38.400 --> 22:39.760
that humans can conquer heaven!

23:03.760 --> 23:05.040
Look!

23:05.120 --> 23:06.880
Who is that?

23:06.960 --> 23:08.560
-What is that?
-Amazing.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.600
It's amazing!

23:14.560 --> 23:15.600
This is…

23:18.400 --> 23:20.360
the light of divine channel.

23:21.600 --> 23:22.640
Zhao Ming…

23:25.640 --> 23:27.680
you actually scattered
your own divine channels.

23:53.480 --> 23:55.200
Evil Emperor Zhao Ming,

23:55.280 --> 23:56.480
for selfish desires,

23:56.560 --> 23:58.400
defied heaven to slay deities

23:58.480 --> 23:59.800
and descended into a demon.

24:00.400 --> 24:03.800
The divine artifacts joined forces
to imprison him in the Lava.

24:04.680 --> 24:05.960
Evil Emperor Zhao Ming,

24:06.040 --> 24:07.520
for selfish desires,

24:08.040 --> 24:09.960
defied heaven to slay deities

24:10.040 --> 24:11.320
and descended into a demon.

24:11.880 --> 24:13.360
The divine artifacts joined forces

24:13.440 --> 24:15.160
to imprison him in the Lava.

24:15.960 --> 24:17.080
Evil Emperor Zhao Ming,

24:17.800 --> 24:19.160
for selfish desires,

24:19.920 --> 24:21.400
defied heaven to slay deities

24:21.480 --> 24:23.120
and descended into a demon.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.960
The divine artifacts joined forces

24:25.040 --> 24:26.880
to imprison him in the Lava.

24:32.080 --> 24:33.480
How could

24:34.880 --> 24:36.640
Zhao Ming descend into a demon?

24:37.520 --> 24:38.440
No way.

24:39.320 --> 24:40.960
This isn't real!

24:41.640 --> 24:42.680
Fate,

24:44.000 --> 24:46.400
what have you done?

24:55.360 --> 24:57.560
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

25:17.680 --> 25:18.880
Who are you?

25:18.960 --> 25:20.040
How dare you invade the Celestial Altar?

25:21.600 --> 25:22.680
All of you

25:23.280 --> 25:24.360
must die!

25:24.440 --> 25:25.360
Seize her!

26:02.720 --> 26:03.920
We plead for Your Grace

26:04.440 --> 26:05.640
to aid the Divine Clan

26:06.160 --> 26:07.640
in erasing this defeat!

26:07.720 --> 26:09.160
Once the Divine Child is born,

26:09.240 --> 26:10.480
the deities will fall.

26:11.040 --> 26:12.240
Fate cannot be changed.

26:12.320 --> 26:14.840
The Divine Clan requests Fate
to suppress Zhao Ming,

26:14.920 --> 26:16.480
but the fall of the Divine Clan

26:16.560 --> 26:18.040
is the price.

26:18.120 --> 26:19.520
This is also destiny.

26:22.480 --> 26:24.560
You cannot find the Divine Child

26:24.640 --> 26:27.440
because you do not understand
what it truly means to be divine.

26:27.520 --> 26:29.680
Divinity is not about race,

26:29.760 --> 26:30.960
nor about lineage.

26:31.040 --> 26:32.640
Only those with compassion

26:32.720 --> 26:34.680
and who protect all beings

26:35.200 --> 26:36.480
are truly divine.

26:37.480 --> 26:38.800
But you

26:39.440 --> 26:40.280
are unworthy!

26:50.760 --> 26:52.800
The Dark Abyss without sunlight

26:53.840 --> 26:55.840
is where you truly belong.

27:37.360 --> 27:39.200
The Chaos Pearl should have remained pure,

27:39.800 --> 27:41.800
but you are lost in love and hate,

27:42.320 --> 27:43.920
no different from mortals.

27:45.440 --> 27:47.720
You've driven yourself into this corner.

27:48.320 --> 27:49.680
Do you regret it?

27:49.760 --> 27:50.720
No regrets.

27:51.840 --> 27:53.160
Every decision

27:53.680 --> 27:55.120
was true to my heart.

27:55.200 --> 27:57.400
I've told you before…

27:58.040 --> 28:00.720
Zhao Ming's relationship with you
was purely for his own gain.

28:00.800 --> 28:03.480
But he never once used me,
not even in the end.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.720
From beginning to end,

28:06.440 --> 28:08.440
he only saw me as Pearl,

28:09.040 --> 28:10.720
not the Chaos Pearl.

28:10.800 --> 28:12.400
Are your feelings

28:13.400 --> 28:14.560
really that cheap?

28:17.120 --> 28:18.200
Fate,

28:19.600 --> 28:21.480
you will never understand love.

28:26.800 --> 28:28.600
Release Zhao Ming!

28:33.240 --> 28:34.320
I will not,

28:34.960 --> 28:35.840
nor can I.

28:36.640 --> 28:37.920
From now on,

28:38.000 --> 28:39.960
there will no longer be
Saint Emperor Zhao Ming,

28:40.480 --> 28:42.360
only Fallen Deity Zhao Ming,

28:43.120 --> 28:44.040
forever imprisoned in the Lava.

28:44.640 --> 28:46.520
Fallen Deity Zhao Ming?

28:48.440 --> 28:50.040
Fate, how dare you!

28:51.120 --> 28:54.280
Humans lack divine channels,
unable to cultivate.

28:55.160 --> 28:58.480
Facing the mighty Divine Clan,
they are powerless to defend themselves,

28:59.400 --> 29:01.880
left to be trampled and slaughtered.

29:03.840 --> 29:05.840
Even at the last moment,

29:06.600 --> 29:09.720
Zhao Ming scattered
his own divine channels to humanity,

29:09.800 --> 29:11.960
so they could cultivate,

29:12.480 --> 29:14.600
no longer living helplessly.

29:15.160 --> 29:16.920
In the eternal night

29:17.520 --> 29:19.000
without a single torch,

29:21.520 --> 29:23.560
he was willing to be the first light.

29:28.000 --> 29:30.040
This is Zhao Ming's noble spirit.

29:32.720 --> 29:34.320
This is the man I love.

29:36.440 --> 29:38.920
If you refuse to rewrite his fate,

29:40.160 --> 29:41.520
then I will

29:42.840 --> 29:44.480
write it myself.

30:11.680 --> 30:14.720
Now that we're both badly hurt,

30:15.240 --> 30:17.000
do you still wish to continue?

30:17.080 --> 30:18.920
I'm still alive!

32:02.120 --> 32:03.960
From this day forward,

32:04.600 --> 32:06.240
your name shall be High Cyclic Divinity.

32:06.760 --> 32:08.640
I have bestowed upon you
the power of reversing time.

32:08.720 --> 32:10.280
You will control time.

32:12.760 --> 32:14.960
Greetings to Your Supreme Deity.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.400
My time is running out.

32:21.120 --> 32:22.440
Listen carefully.

32:23.400 --> 32:26.520
The Divine Clan
was destroyed by Zhao Ming and me.

32:27.800 --> 32:29.440
Yet Zhao Ming became a demon,

32:29.960 --> 32:31.000
imprisoned in the Lava.

32:31.840 --> 32:33.480
I will also fall into sleep soon,

32:33.560 --> 32:35.160
losing all my memories,

32:35.240 --> 32:37.120
unable to save Zhao Ming again.

32:38.720 --> 32:40.000
Only by casting his blood essence

32:40.680 --> 32:42.320
into the cycle of rebirth

32:43.000 --> 32:45.760
can there be hope for a reunion

32:45.840 --> 32:47.000
thousands of years later.

32:47.080 --> 32:48.840
After a deadly battle against Fate,

32:48.920 --> 32:50.280
when he was gravely wounded,

32:51.040 --> 32:52.560
is this the slim chance for survival

32:52.640 --> 32:55.080
Your Supreme Deity secured for Zhao Ming?

32:56.240 --> 32:58.160
These words, these events,

32:58.680 --> 33:00.000
you will likely soon forget.

33:01.720 --> 33:03.520
All memories of Zhao Ming

33:04.320 --> 33:06.120
will be altered by Fate.

33:14.800 --> 33:16.080
You only need to remember this.

33:17.360 --> 33:18.600
You must wait here.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.760
Many years from now,

33:21.400 --> 33:23.520
someone will come here.

33:24.240 --> 33:26.000
No matter what wish he makes,

33:26.520 --> 33:27.880
you must agree to it

33:27.960 --> 33:28.840
and help him.

33:29.480 --> 33:30.520
Understood.

33:33.040 --> 33:34.320
I can't say any more.

33:34.840 --> 33:37.000
If I reveal the fate, it will be erased.

33:37.840 --> 33:39.400
That would ruin everything.

33:39.920 --> 33:41.200
After you lose your memory,

33:41.280 --> 33:44.160
how can you find his blood essence again?

33:51.360 --> 33:53.080
After thousands of years,

33:54.280 --> 33:55.840
in the vast sea of mortals,

33:57.600 --> 33:59.280
the one I fall in love with

34:01.360 --> 34:02.560
will be him.

34:15.520 --> 34:17.159
What exactly did you do?

34:17.760 --> 34:20.320
The Book of Fate and the Chaos Pearl

34:20.840 --> 34:22.440
are interdependent and opposed.

34:22.960 --> 34:24.840
You cannot control my fate,

34:25.440 --> 34:27.520
and I cannot override your laws.

34:28.280 --> 34:29.520
But, Fate,

34:30.600 --> 34:32.600
even if the Book of Fate is burned

34:33.120 --> 34:34.560
and the Chaos Pearl loses its light,

34:35.360 --> 34:37.040
I will never yield.

35:16.920 --> 35:18.120
Love…

35:19.000 --> 35:20.760
What is love, truly?

35:39.960 --> 35:41.640
No matter the bets' outcome,

35:42.720 --> 35:44.240
I will not let you die.

36:10.560 --> 36:11.400
Fate,

36:11.920 --> 36:13.520
you have disturbed the heavenly laws.

36:13.600 --> 36:15.320
Your sin is unforgivable.

36:39.480 --> 36:41.560
I have transferred the Chaos Pearl's

36:41.640 --> 36:43.680
emotional fate onto myself.

36:48.840 --> 36:50.800
Your Grace can destroy me.

36:50.880 --> 36:53.400
Destroying you would be too easy

36:53.480 --> 36:54.400
for your sins.

36:55.160 --> 36:57.360
I shall punish you by sending you
into the mortal realm,

36:57.440 --> 37:00.280
cursed by fate for all eternity.

37:00.360 --> 37:01.520
None of your wishes will be fulfilled,

37:01.600 --> 37:03.520
and you will be abandoned

37:03.600 --> 37:05.920
by your love ones in every life.

37:06.000 --> 37:08.480
You say I don't understand love.

37:10.320 --> 37:12.320
Then I will also descend
into the mortal realm

37:12.920 --> 37:14.320
to see for myself

37:15.520 --> 37:17.400
what this "love" you speak of

37:18.680 --> 37:20.320
truly is.

37:23.120 --> 37:24.560
At that time,

37:26.280 --> 37:27.480
you will return to me,

37:29.320 --> 37:30.320
won't you?

37:37.320 --> 37:38.360
So,

37:39.280 --> 37:40.840
Zhao Ming and Xie Xuechen

37:41.400 --> 37:43.040
were truly one before.

37:46.680 --> 37:47.560
It was you.

37:47.640 --> 37:50.160
You altered Zhao Ming's fate,
turned right to wrong,

37:50.240 --> 37:52.160
made him believe that Pearl betrayed him,

37:52.240 --> 37:53.400
and suppressed him as a demon.

37:53.480 --> 37:55.800
Even he himself believed

37:55.880 --> 37:57.200
he was the bloodthirsty Demon Lord,

37:57.280 --> 37:59.280
seeking to rule the world.

38:01.920 --> 38:03.040
Zhao Ming is virtuous,

38:03.120 --> 38:04.400
Xie Xuechen is righteous,

38:04.480 --> 38:06.680
but the Demon Lord was force-fed
with evil thoughts.

38:08.560 --> 38:09.800
What wrong did he commit?

38:11.840 --> 38:13.640
As for right and wrong,

38:14.680 --> 38:15.840
there are no definitive answers.

38:15.920 --> 38:18.280
Everything is fate.

38:18.360 --> 38:21.520
To make the most virtuous person
bear the most evil name,

38:22.040 --> 38:23.720
is this the fate you gave him?

38:24.720 --> 38:25.960
Ten thousand years of fate

38:26.040 --> 38:28.000
are all in the stroke of your pen.

38:28.080 --> 38:31.000
Now, reverse Zhao Ming's fate!

38:31.560 --> 38:34.880
The Book of Fate can only change
one person's fate once.

38:36.600 --> 38:38.360
Moreover, the condition for changing fate

38:38.440 --> 38:40.240
is that someone must request it

38:40.320 --> 38:42.560
and pay an equal price.

38:43.240 --> 38:45.840
Ten thousand years ago,
the Divine Clan fell,

38:46.760 --> 38:48.920
and that was the price
to suppress Zhao Ming.

38:49.760 --> 38:52.000
Now, if you want to change his fate,

38:52.680 --> 38:54.520
the entire world

38:55.280 --> 38:57.720
has no one who can bear the same cost.

38:58.680 --> 38:59.760
I don't believe it.

39:06.200 --> 39:07.600
Why bother forcibly taking
the Book of Fate?

39:07.680 --> 39:09.200
I have already told you,

39:09.280 --> 39:11.920
Zhao Ming's fate cannot be changed.

39:12.000 --> 39:13.520
Hearing is false,

39:13.600 --> 39:14.680
and seeing is believing.

39:15.280 --> 39:17.800
All of this should've already returned
to its rightful course!

39:42.240 --> 39:45.520
"Zhao Ming descended into a demon.
His fate was sealed.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.600
It can never be reversed."

39:52.720 --> 39:56.240
"The fate of a fallen deity
can still be purified

39:56.920 --> 39:58.720
with the Waterless Land's water
cleansing his demonic body

39:58.800 --> 40:01.160
and the Snow Cliff's ice
sealing his demonic bones.

40:02.360 --> 40:04.160
Then, the Chaos Power can purify it."

40:04.960 --> 40:06.000
This is

40:07.160 --> 40:09.040
the method to purify the Demon Lord.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.560
Close!

40:29.640 --> 40:30.600
The Book of Fate

40:30.680 --> 40:32.160
clearly records the method
to purify the Demon Lord.

40:32.240 --> 40:33.400
Why didn't you tell me?

40:34.640 --> 40:35.840
Yes,

40:37.080 --> 40:39.200
use the world's most yang water

40:39.760 --> 40:42.840
from the Waterless Land
to soak his demonic body,

40:42.920 --> 40:44.520
and use the world's most yin ice

40:44.600 --> 40:47.280
from the Snow Cliff
to seal his demonic bones.

40:47.360 --> 40:49.760
Then, infuse it with the Chaos Power.

40:50.600 --> 40:53.320
This will drive away his demonic thoughts
and cleanse his demonic body.

40:56.800 --> 40:58.520
But the Demon Lord's evil thoughts
are very strong,

40:58.600 --> 41:00.280
and he hates you to the core.

41:00.360 --> 41:03.200
If you go to perform the purifying,

41:03.760 --> 41:05.240
he'll easily kill you.

41:07.000 --> 41:07.960
You must not proceed.

41:10.680 --> 41:12.200
No matter the cost,

41:12.800 --> 41:14.440
I will purify the Demon Lord.

41:14.520 --> 41:16.520
Zhao Ming devoted his heart to the world.

41:17.440 --> 41:19.400
He doesn't deserve such an end.

41:20.720 --> 41:22.560
Xie Xuechen risked his life
to protect this world.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.400
I must safeguard it on his behalf.

41:28.360 --> 41:29.200
Hey…

41:29.920 --> 41:30.760
What's wrong with you?

41:33.040 --> 41:35.320
Forcibly activating the Fate Array

41:36.240 --> 41:38.240
has already consumed much of my strength.

41:38.320 --> 41:42.200
Moreover, just now,
you clashed with me using the Chaos Power.

41:42.800 --> 41:44.640
Even a divine body

41:45.320 --> 41:47.120
would suffer greatly from such burden.

41:47.880 --> 41:49.080
Ten thousand years ago,

41:50.640 --> 41:52.480
you took my emotional fate

41:53.280 --> 41:54.560
to save my life

41:55.400 --> 41:57.920
at the cost of subjecting yourself
to the pain of rebirth.

41:58.880 --> 42:00.120
Over these 10,000 years of rebirth,

42:00.720 --> 42:01.880
what have you experienced?

42:05.240 --> 42:06.960
In these 10,000 years,

42:09.320 --> 42:11.120
I've been many different people.

42:11.200 --> 42:12.760
An emperor,

42:13.600 --> 42:14.800
a general,

42:15.960 --> 42:17.280
a scholar,

42:17.920 --> 42:18.760
a performer,

42:19.760 --> 42:21.000
a beggar…

42:23.120 --> 42:24.720
lowly,

42:24.800 --> 42:26.120
noble…

42:27.960 --> 42:29.280
Too many to count,

42:30.480 --> 42:31.920
and too many to remember.

42:33.600 --> 42:35.160
Yet in every life,

42:36.440 --> 42:38.240
I barely remembered

42:39.720 --> 42:41.320
that I was searching for something,

42:43.120 --> 42:45.040
as if it were an object,

42:45.120 --> 42:46.720
or perhaps,

42:48.080 --> 42:49.600
a person.

42:54.200 --> 42:56.480
It wasn't until this life as Nan Xuyue

42:58.000 --> 42:59.640
that I finally understood

43:01.120 --> 43:02.680
what I was searching for

43:04.120 --> 43:05.320
was you.

43:08.160 --> 43:11.040
I've sought you
through 10,000 years of rebirth.

43:12.800 --> 43:14.920
You have been in a deep sleep
all this time.

43:17.760 --> 43:18.760
But that's fine.

43:23.480 --> 43:25.400
Anyway, in this life,

43:27.520 --> 43:29.840
I have finally found you.
